[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 35160.87, "timestamp": "09:46:00", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35163.266, "timestamp": "09:46:03", "text": "不錯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35165.19, "timestamp": "09:46:05", "text": "所以，這些就像是文物一樣。這些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35168.87, "timestamp": "09:46:08", "text": "就像盔甲、神器之類的東西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35171.03, "timestamp": "09:46:11", "text": "所以，這些是我需要做的卡片。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35174.39, "timestamp": "09:46:14", "text": "所以，這就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35177.426, "timestamp": "09:46:17", "text": "狩獵的意義所在。這是什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35182.31, "timestamp": "09:46:22", "text": "這張卡可以用於哪些用途？讓我查一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35184.87, "timestamp": "09:46:24", "text": "它不是萊特幣。哦，等等。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35189.03, "timestamp": "09:46:29", "text": "萊特幣。好的。打獵。誰有狩獵"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35190.63, "timestamp": "09:46:30", "text": "活動？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35193.51, "timestamp": "09:46:33", "text": "好的，我可以用它來做這件事。等等，我本來可以給"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35196.95, "timestamp": "09:46:36", "text": "唐用，但是不行，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35203.03, "timestamp": "09:46:43", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35206.71, "timestamp": "09:46:46", "text": "所以，我不能把它用在黎明身上。  哦。"}]